        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dal Lake, Srinagar, Jammu and Kashmir, Waterton Lake, Alberta, Montana, Canada, United States\n- Products: Shikara\n- Concepts: mountain lakes, naming/misnomers\n\nFacts:\n- Dal is a lake in Srinagar, the summer capital of Jammu and Kashmir.\n- In Kashmiri, the term \"Dal Lake\" is a misnomer because \"Dal\" means lake.\n- Waterton Lake is a mountain lake in southern Alberta, Canada, and northern Montana, United States.\n- A shikara is a type of wooden boat found on Dal Lake and other water bodies of Srinagar, Jammu and Kashmir, India.",
